{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge of the Gods and fight them in the <strong>fast-paced deckbuilder</strong> fused <strong>with grid-based tactics</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight</strong> with the <strong>unique deck</strong> that you <strong>build on the fly</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover cards</strong> which work efficiently together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>T</strong>here are <strong>75 unique cards</strong>, each has its own <strong>skill tree</strong>, each has it's own character,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/ready.png?t=1748694989\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/Combo_final.gif?t=1748694989\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/combos.png?t=1748694989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Considering the cards you have and gain during the run, manipulate the tiles of <strong>hex-based battlefield</strong> to get advantage. And don't let enemies to use them against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn </strong>special abilities of each enemy - and invent ways to turn them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet horrifying gods-bosses and burn them from existence by your unstoppable flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/Movie_005.gif?t=1748694989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage into existential conversations with your avatar - <strong>God of Destruction</strong> named <strong>Shakrah</strong>. Will He be always agree on who is actually in charge here? Sure, He will always have something to discuss with you and something to argue about. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/Talking_shakrah-final.gif?t=1748694989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/dont_forget_to.png?t=1748694989\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/Walking.gif?t=1748694989\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/fun.png?t=1748694989\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2489340?t=1748694989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2489340?t=1748694989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748694989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748694989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2556900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge of the Gods and fight them in the <strong>fast-paced deckbuilder</strong> fused <strong>with grid-based tactics</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight</strong> with the <strong>unique deck</strong> that you <strong>build on the fly</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover cards</strong> which work efficiently together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>T</strong>here are <strong>75 unique cards</strong>, each has its own <strong>skill tree</strong>, each has it's own character,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta